                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "We recently dined at Liang Xi Hao, and it was a truly standout experience. The food was absolutely great, providing a delicious and memorable meal.\n\nFor anyone visiting, I have three must try recommendations: the Squid Soup, the Fried Vermicelli, and the Deep Fried Burdock. The combination of fresh ingredients and expertly balanced flavors made these dishes simply marvelous. If you\u0027re looking for truly delicious food, Liang Xi Hao is a superb choice.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
