                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "兩喜號 Liang Xi Hao – 總店\nThis place is an awesome spot for traditional Taiwanese snacks with a modern twist! The flavors are rich, the ingredients taste fresh, and everything feels homemade with care. The staff are warm and welcoming, and the shop has a cozy, nostalgic vibe. It’s a great stop if you want a quick, tasty bite that really captures the local Taiwanese flavor. Perfect for both tourists and locals looking for something satisfying and classic!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
